<!-- PCL 自定义主页
     上排：4 个文件夹快捷按钮，下面一条“刷新背景图片”。
     右侧下部：日志文件夹按钮 + 自定义指令管理器入口。
     中段左侧“游戏日志”只读框，只显示正在运行的游戏进程日志；
           没有游戏进程、未进入游戏或进程被关闭时自动恢复空白。
     中段右侧“上一次启动”只读框，显示上一次游戏启动的日志（logs 里最新的
           YYYY-MM-DD-N.log.gz，解压后显示）；“记事本”按钮打开解压后的副本。
     两份日志等宽平分中段，最右侧“日志文件夹”按钮打开日志来源文件夹。
     下部“启动器日志”只读框显示本次 PCL 会话的日志快照。
     按钮执行原理：每个按钮用 wscript.exe 启动 PCLHomeLaunch.vbs（GUI 子系统，不创建控制台），
     VBS 再以隐藏窗口运行 CustomTools.bat 或 PowerShell。CustomTools.bat 存在时直接调用它，
     不存在时先用隐藏 PowerShell 从本文件末尾的内嵌备份里自动重建工具脚本，
     并把内嵌的共享背景图导入 PCL\Pictures 文件夹，然后再调用。
     因此工具文件丢失（误删、复制主页到新环境）时，点一下任意按钮即可自动恢复。
     CustomTools.bat 在点击时才现场读取设置（PCL2 的 Setup.ini 或 PCL CE 的 config.v1.yml），
     切换游戏版本后无需刷新主页。
     CustomTools.bat 参数：game / mods / saves / schematics / bg / logs / glog / glogprev / glogdir / log1 / commands
        commands = 打开独立的自定义指令管理器（CommandManager.ps1）
        bg   = 直接驱动 PCL 设置页刷新背景图片，不重启启动器（见 BgRefresh.ps1）
        glog = 用记事本打开正在运行的游戏日志（latest.log）
        glogprev = 用记事本打开上一次游戏启动的日志（最新的 YYYY-MM-DD-N.log.gz，先解压到临时文件）。
        glogdir = 用资源管理器打开游戏日志文件夹（运行中取游戏目录，否则取所选实例的 logs）
        logN = 用记事本打开 N-1 次启动的启动器日志（log1 为当前会话）
        logs = 重新生成日志快照 PCL\LogView.xaml，并让 PCL 重载主页（模拟按 F5）
     日志显示原理：PCL 不允许主页直接读文件（ObjectDataProvider、x:Static 等都会被安全检查拒绝），
     所以由 RefreshLog.ps1 把当前游戏日志、上一次启动日志与启动器日志转成 PCL\LogView.xaml（ResourceDictionary 文本快照），
     主页在解析时合并该字典，把日志字符串显示在只读文本框里。
     LogView.xaml 缺失或版本过旧时，CustomTools.bat 每次运行都会自动重建，避免主页加载失败。
      自动更新：登录自启动项 PCLCustomHomeWatch 通过 wscript.exe 无窗口启动后台守护脚本（RefreshLog.ps1 -Watch，单实例）：
      每两秒重扫一次快照并刷新主页，游戏启动、退出、进程被结束、PCL 重新打开时也会立即重建；
      把 PCL 切到最前（成为前台窗口）时再补刷新一次。所有自动 F5 只在 PCL 处于前台且显示“启动”
      页面时按下（切到下载、设置等页面时不打扰，回到启动页后自动补刷新）。守护脚本未运行时，
      点任意按钮会自动把它拉起来。
     日志区高度自适应：根 Grid 高度绑定页面滚动条的 ViewportHeight；
     底部 341 像素区域 = 启动器日志面板 291 + 底部留白 50（与页面上方留白对称）；
     -130 的下外边距让 PCL 自带的快照版提示卡片（若显示）叠加在日志底部之上。
     按钮外观：50% 透明白色圆角块、无边框；MyButton 本体全透明（Opacity=0）只负责点击。
     文件末尾的内嵌备份注释：保存 CustomTools.bat、PCLHomeLaunch.vbs、RefreshLog.ps1、
     BgRefresh.ps1、Egg.ps1、VideoWall.ps1、CommandManager.ps1 与共享背景图（CustomHomeBG.jpg 的 base64 内容）；
     请勿修改 @@ 标记行，注释内不能出现连续的两个减号。
      彩蛋（Shift+X+C，仅在 PCL 窗口前台时）：在无控制台的图形确认框中选择 Yes 后，把主题图片
      设为 Windows 桌面壁纸（PCL\Pictures\CustomHomeBG.jpg），并把锁屏换成同款图片
      （CustomHomeLock.png）；选择 No 则什么都不改。视频桌面壁纸不再使用：新版 Explorer 没有
      可供播放器挂靠的桌面背景层，动画在这台机器上显示不出来，静态壁纸才是实际能看到的效果。
      -->

<Grid Margin="0,0,0,-130"
      Height="{Binding ViewportHeight, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=ScrollViewer}}">
    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
        <RowDefinition Height="*" MinHeight="200" />
        <RowDefinition Height="291" />
        <RowDefinition Height="50" />
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

    <Grid.Resources>
        <!-- 日志文本快照：由 RefreshLog.ps1 生成 PCL\LogView.xaml，这里合并进来 -->
        <ResourceDictionary>
            <ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
                <ResourceDictionary Source="file:///{path}\PCL/LogView.xaml" />
            </ResourceDictionary.MergedDictionaries>
        </ResourceDictionary>
    </Grid.Resources>

    <Grid Grid.Row="0">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="1*" />
            <ColumnDefinition Width="1*" />
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

        <!-- 左上角：当前实例文件夹，下面接 schematics 文件夹 -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,5,0">
            <Grid>
                <Border Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                    <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_GAME@@" FontSize="13" Margin="12,0"
                               Foreground="#FF000000"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                </Border>
                <local:MyButton Height="35" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool game"
                                ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_GAME_TIP@@" />
            </Grid>
            <Grid Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <Border Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                    <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_SCHEMATICS@@" FontSize="13" Margin="12,0"
                               Foreground="#FF000000"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                </Border>
                <local:MyButton Height="35" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool schematics"
                                ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_SCHEMATICS_TIP@@" />
            </Grid>
        </StackPanel>

        <!-- 右上角：Mod 文件夹，下面接 saves 文件夹 -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="5,0,0,0">
            <Grid>
                <Border Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                    <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_MODS@@" FontSize="13" Margin="12,0"
                               Foreground="#FF000000"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                </Border>
                <local:MyButton Height="35" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool mods"
                                ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_MODS_TIP@@" />
            </Grid>
            <Grid Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <Border Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                    <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_SAVES@@" FontSize="13" Margin="12,0"
                               Foreground="#FF000000"
                               HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                               IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                </Border>
                <local:MyButton Height="35" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool saves"
                                ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_SAVES_TIP@@" />
            </Grid>
        </StackPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- 刷新背景图片：驱动 PCL 设置页原生刷新，不重启启动器 -->
    <Grid Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,8,0,0">
        <Border Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
            <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_REFRESH_BG@@" FontSize="13" Margin="12,0"
                       Foreground="#FF000000"
                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                       IsHitTestVisible="False" />
        </Border>
        <local:MyButton Height="35" Text="" Opacity="0"
                        EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool bg"
                        ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_REFRESH_BG_TIP@@" />
    </Grid>

    <!-- 中部：左侧游戏日志（只读，可滚动、可选中复制），右侧历史日志用记事本打开 -->
    <Grid Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,8,0,0">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="1*" />
            <ColumnDefinition Width="8" />
            <ColumnDefinition Width="1*" />
            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

        <Border Grid.Column="0" Background="#B31E1E1E" CornerRadius="3" Padding="8,6">
            <Grid>
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_GAME_LOG@@" FontSize="13" Foreground="#FFF0F0F0"
                                   VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />

                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                        <Grid Width="66">
                            <Border Background="#66FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3" />
                            <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_REFRESH_LOG@@" FontSize="12"
                                       Foreground="#FF000000"
                                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                            <local:MyButton Height="26" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                            EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool logs"
                                            ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_REFRESH_LOG_TIP@@" />
                        </Grid>
                        <Grid Width="92" Margin="6,0,0,0">
                            <Border Background="#66FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3" />
                            <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_NOTEPAD@@" FontSize="12"
                                       Foreground="#FF000000"
                                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                            <local:MyButton Height="26" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                            EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool glog"
                                            ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_GAME_LOG_TIP@@" />
                        </Grid>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Grid>

                <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Text="{StaticResource LogViewText}"
                         Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="0,2,0,0"
                         Foreground="#FFE8E8E8" FontSize="12"
                         FontFamily="Consolas, Microsoft YaHei UI"
                         IsReadOnly="True" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                         VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" />
            </Grid>
        </Border>

        <!-- 右侧：上一次游戏启动的日志（RefreshLog.ps1 生成的快照） -->
        <Border Grid.Column="2" Background="#B31E1E1E" CornerRadius="3" Padding="8,6">
            <Grid>
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_PREVIOUS_LOG@@" FontSize="13" Foreground="#FFF0F0F0"
                                   VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                        <TextBlock Text="{StaticResource PreviousGameLogLabel}" FontSize="11" Margin="8,0,0,0"
                                   Foreground="#FFB8B8B8" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                        <Grid Width="92">
                            <Border Background="#66FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3" />
                            <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_NOTEPAD@@" FontSize="12"
                                       Foreground="#FF000000"
                                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                            <local:MyButton Height="26" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                            EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool glogprev"
                                            ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_PREVIOUS_LOG_TIP@@" />
                        </Grid>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Grid>

                <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Text="{StaticResource PreviousGameLogText}"
                         Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="0,2,0,0"
                         Foreground="#FFE8E8E8" FontSize="12"
                         FontFamily="Consolas, Microsoft YaHei UI"
                         IsReadOnly="True" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                         VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" />
            </Grid>
        </Border>

        <Grid Grid.Column="3" Width="122" Margin="8,0,0,0">
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                <RowDefinition Height="8" />
                <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                <RowDefinition Height="8" />
                <RowDefinition Height="*" />
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>

            <Border Grid.Row="0" VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                    Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                <Grid x:Name="LogFolderButtonArea" VerticalAlignment="Stretch">
                    <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5">
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_LOG_FOLDER@@" FontSize="12.5" Margin="0,0,0,7"
                                   Foreground="#FF000000"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_LOG_FOLDER@@" FontSize="11.5"
                                   Foreground="#FF000000"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <local:MyButton HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                    EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool glogdir"
                                    />
                </Grid>
            </Border>

            <!-- 右侧中间：独立的陶瓦联机窗口 -->
            <Border Grid.Row="2" VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                    Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                <Grid x:Name="OnlineButtonArea" VerticalAlignment="Stretch">
                    <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5">
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_ONLINE@@" FontSize="12.5" Margin="0,0,0,7"
                                   Foreground="#FF000000"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_ONLINE@@" FontSize="11.5"
                                   Foreground="#FF000000"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <local:MyButton HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                    EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; online"
                                    ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_ONLINE_TIP@@" />
                </Grid>
            </Border>

            <!-- 右侧下方：独立的自定义指令管理器 -->
            <Border Grid.Row="4" VerticalAlignment="Stretch"
                    Background="#80FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3">
                <Grid x:Name="CommandButtonArea" VerticalAlignment="Stretch">
                    <StackPanel HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="5">
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_COMMANDS@@" FontSize="12.5" Margin="0,0,0,7"
                                   Foreground="#FF000000"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_COMMANDS@@" FontSize="11.5"
                                   Foreground="#FF000000"
                                   HorizontalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                    </StackPanel>
                    <local:MyButton HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" VerticalAlignment="Stretch" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                    EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; commands"
                                    ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_COMMANDS_TIP@@" />
                </Grid>
            </Border>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>

    <!-- 下部：启动器日志（本次 PCL2 / PCL CE 会话日志的快照）；吃掉页面剩余空间 -->
    <Grid Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,8,0,0">
        <Border Background="#B31E1E1E" CornerRadius="3" Padding="8,6">
            <Grid>
                <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                    <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                    <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,5">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_LAUNCHER_LOG@@" FontSize="13" Foreground="#FFF0F0F0"
                                   VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" />

                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                        <Grid Width="92">
                            <Border Background="#66FFFFFF" CornerRadius="3" />
                            <TextBlock Text="@@PCLHOME_NOTEPAD@@" FontSize="12"
                                       Foreground="#FF000000"
                                       HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                       IsHitTestVisible="False" />
                            <local:MyButton Height="26" Text="" Opacity="0"
                                            EventType="打开文件" EventData="wscript.exe|//B //Nologo &quot;{path}\PCL\PCLHomeLaunch.vbs&quot; tool log1"
                                            ToolTip="@@PCLHOME_OPEN_LAUNCHER_LOG_TIP@@" />
                        </Grid>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Grid>

                <TextBox Grid.Row="1" Text="{StaticResource LauncherLogText}"
                         Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="0,2,0,0"
                         Foreground="#FFE8E8E8" FontSize="11.5"
                         FontFamily="Consolas, Microsoft YaHei UI"
                         IsReadOnly="True" AcceptsReturn="True" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                         VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" />
            </Grid>
        </Border>
    </Grid>
</Grid>
